    {
      "text": "The OpenHIE logo: a teal and blue circular/plus-shaped icon beside the wordmark 'OpenHIE'. It represents the interoperability framework referenced in Fig. 5.6.2, which illustrates how mHero integrates digital health interventions using standards.",
